/ This program assembles without a single error, and is wrong in four ways.
/ Every one of them is something the linter catches:
/
/   $ marie lint examples/hazards.mas

        Load  First
        Add   Second
        Skipcond 100        / not a condition: silently tests AC < 0
        JnS   Report        / the return slot holds an instruction
Report, Output
First,  DEC 21              / execution falls into the data below
Second, DEC 21
